SUMMARY:The Monti StorySLAM @ Motorco
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLast minute and definitely not free!\n\nGoing to a Monti: StorySLAM tomorrow. I have enjoyed these every time I have gone. If you haven't been I HIGHLY recommend you go to one.\n\nThis is the last of the regular season before the grand slam.\n\nEither I'll see ya there or I'm going myself lol\n\nHere's the link to buy tickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/saints-and-sinners-storyslam-tickets-1983619640743?aff=oddtdtcreator
