SUMMARY:Standup Comedy @ Durty Bull Brewing Company
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nEy! Do you love to laugh? I love to laugh! This comedy open mic features a delicious blend of tender rookies and slow roasted\, perfectly seasoned comedic veterans of the NC triangle area.\n\nLooking forward to laughs and good vibes! Comedy starts at 8pm and we’ll meet before it starts and find seats\n\nParking there and the surrounding streets like Broadway Street\, W Corporation Street and North Street
